---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Technical Focus — Hoss"
  description="Technical interests, selected implementation experience, and working approach across AI, image processing, data, and software."
>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">TECHNICAL PROFILE</div>
      <h1>Understanding<span class="accent-period">.</span><br />Building<span class="accent-period">.</span><br />Evaluating<span class="accent-period">.</span></h1>
      <p class="about-lead">An implementation-focused approach to artificial intelligence, image and signal processing, data analysis, and software engineering.</p>
      <div class="about-actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:contact@hdfmy.ir">Email ↗</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/h02s" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content-grid">
      <article class="about-main">
        <div class="eyebrow">WORKING APPROACH</div>
        <h2>Strong foundations, practical implementation, careful evaluation.</h2>
        <p>I am interested in research and engineering that connect theoretical understanding with working implementations. I enjoy exploring a problem, reviewing relevant technical material, building a reproducible experiment, and analyzing the results rather than relying on claims alone.</p>
        <p>My hands-on work includes Django application development and backend integrations, speech denoising experiments using FFT and STFT, local Persian speech model setup, and experimentation with local language-model inference.</p>
        <p>I am particularly interested in methods that make intelligent systems useful under practical constraints, including limited compute, memory, latency, and energy budgets.</p>
      </article>
      <aside class="about-side">
        <div class="about-box"><div class="eyebrow">AI & DATA</div><h3>Learning systems</h3><p>Machine learning, deep learning fundamentals, neural networks, reinforcement learning, NLP, LLMs, RAG, and multimodal learning.</p></div>
        <div class="about-box"><div class="eyebrow">VISION & SIGNALS</div><h3>Perception and analysis</h3><p>Computer vision, image preprocessing, detection and segmentation fundamentals, FFT, STFT, filtering, and time-frequency analysis.</p></div>
        <div class="about-box"><div class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING</div><h3>Tools and infrastructure</h3><p>Python, Django, APIs, scientific Python, Hugging Face, local inference, Debian Linux, Git, Docker, and Incus/LXC.</p></div>
      </aside>
    </section>
    <section class="about-bottom">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">GUIDING PRINCIPLE</div><h2>Understand the problem. Build carefully. Measure honestly.</h2></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/#research">Explore research interests ↗</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>